WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.385 --> 00:00:04.668
Unit five. Risk Behaviors and Decision-Making!

2
00:00:05.678 --> 00:00:10.304
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:10.354 --> 00:00:13.321
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.371 --> 00:00:18.555
Today we learn about Risk Behaviors and Decision-Making. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.842 --> 00:00:24.242
Risk behavior. Say it with me. Risk behavior!

6
00:00:27.726 --> 00:00:32.243
Impulse control. Say it with me. Impulse control!

7
00:00:35.711 --> 00:00:39.828
Consequence. Say it with me. Consequence!

8
00:00:43.345 --> 00:00:47.845
Peer influence. Say it with me. Peer influence!

9
00:00:51.365 --> 00:00:56.348
Informed decision. Say it with me. Informed decision!

10
00:00:59.848 --> 00:01:06.015
Long-term effect. Say it with me. Long-term effect!

11
00:01:09.525 --> 00:01:13.725
Safety first. Say it with me. Safety first!

12
00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:21.753
Accountability. Say it with me. Accountability!

13
00:01:25.274 --> 00:01:40.478
A risk behavior often happens because of low impulse control or strong peer influence. Thinking about the consequence and long-term effect supports an informed decision. Putting safety first shows real accountability.

14
00:01:40.528 --> 00:01:43.970
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:44.793 --> 00:01:50.060
