16
00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.379
Consequence!

17
00:01:52.511 --> 00:01:57.920
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:57.970 --> 00:01:59.363
Safety first!

19
00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:11.654
Did you know? The part of the brain responsible for weighing long-term consequences continues developing until about age 25.

20
00:02:11.704 --> 00:02:14.200
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:14.899 --> 00:02:23.394
Think and answer. What helps you make informed decisions under pressure?

22
00:02:23.444 --> 00:02:24.594
Great answer!

23
